 . What do you suggest?" resource-id="com.google.android.googlequicksearchbox:id/assistant_robin_user_message_text" class="android.widget.TextView" package="com.google.android.googlequicksearchbox" content-desc="" checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="false" enabled="true" focusable="false" focused="false" scrollable="false" long-clickable="false" password="false" selected="false" bounds="[182,296][1014,539]" drawing-order="1" hint="" /></node></node><node index="1" text="" resource-id="com.google.android.googlequicksearchbox:id/assistant_robin_content_message_container" class="android.view.ViewGroup" package="com.google.android.googlequicksearchbox" content-desc="" checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="false" enabled="true" focusable="false" focused="false" scrollable="false" long-clickable="false" password="false" selected="false" bounds="[66,605][1014,2400]" drawing-order="2" hint=""><node index="1" text="" resource-id="com.google.android.googlequicksearchbox:id/assistant_robin_message_content" class="android.support.v7.widget.RecyclerView" package="com.google.android.googlequicksearchbox" content-desc="" checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="false" enabled="true" focusable="true" focused="false" scrollable="false" long-clickable="false" password="false" selected="false" bounds="[66,605][1014,2400]" drawing-order="16" hint=""><node index="0" text="Choosing the right coffee machine depends on how you like your coffee, how much time you want to spend making it, and whether you are brewing for one person or a crowd. Here are the top suggestions broken down by category.&#10;​1. Drip Coffee Makers&#10;​If you prefer classic black coffee and want a dependable machine that can brew a full pot quickly, drip coffee makers are the most practical choice.&#10;​Technivorm Moccamaster: Best for unmatched build quality and longevity, featuring a hand-built design that consistently brews at optimal temperatures.&#10;​OXO Brew 8-Cup Coffee Maker: Best compact, SCA-certified machine featuring a precise rain shower head and a drip-free thermal carafe.  &#10;​Ninja 12-Cup Programmable Brewer: Best value choice for reliable daily brewing with handy scheduling features.&#10;​2. Single-Serve Pod Machines&#10;​If convenience, speed, and zero mess are your main goals, pod machines allow you to brew a single cup instantly.&#10;​Keurig K-Classic: Best for traditional K-Cup pods, offering quick cleanup and hundreds of beverage options from coffee to tea.  &#10;​Nespresso VertuoPlus: Best for those who want rich espresso or full-sized coffee mugs topped with a smooth crema layer using capsule technology.  &#10;​3. Espresso Machines&#10;​If you enjoy lattes, cappuccinos, or authentic espresso shots and want to channel your inner barista, an espresso maker is the ideal route.&#10;​Breville Bambino Plus: Best semi-automatic machine for home use, offering rapid heat-up times, professional pressure, and automated milk texturing in a compact package.&#10;​4. Cold Brew and Specialty Makers&#10;​If you mostly drink cold brew or want flexibility for iced beverages:&#10;​Ninja Specialty Coffee Maker: Best for multi-style brewing, including rich coffee concentrates designed specifically to stand up to ice without tasting watered down.&#10;​OXO Brew Cold Brew Maker: Best for smooth, low-acidity cold brew concentrate made automatically in batches without messy filters.&#10;​The video below gives a helpful visual overview of different coffee maker types and what factors to consider before making your purchase." resource-id="com.google.android.googlequicksearchbox:id/assistant_robin_text" class="android.widget.TextView" package="com.google.android.googlequicksearchbox" content-desc="" checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="false" enabled="true" focusable="true" focused="false" scrollable="false" long-clickable="false" password="false" selected="false" bounds="[66,616][1014,2400]" drawing-order="1" hint="" /></node></node></node></node><node